alue="[for each candidate]" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="75" y="628" width="420" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c45" value="loop" style="shape=umlFrame;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;width=50;height=20;fillColor=none;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="932" width="2416" height="38" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c46" value="[for each approved command]" style="text;html=1;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="75" y="932" width="420" height="20" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c47" value="Alternative / exception flows and notes:&lt;br&gt;• The syllabus file is stored by uploadFiles() as in SD01 before extraction starts&lt;br&gt;• [text cannot be extracted / LLM unavailable / no deadline found] the user enters deadlines manually&lt;br&gt;• [malformed LLM output] retry, then report the failure&lt;br&gt;• [date not in source text or outside the semester] the item is flagged with a warning&lt;br&gt;• [relative date such as &amp;#x27;Week 5&amp;#x27;] converted using the semester start date and shown for confirmation&lt;br&gt;• [no date or TBD] saved as an undated deadline; StatusBar shows a message&lt;br&gt;• [duplicate deadline] the user is asked whether to merge" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=11;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1130" width="1100" height="136" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>